   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">HEA-R5: Primary health</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activities within Oromia region:   1: Provide trainings and education to 300 community members on preventive health care
 2: Provide 150 malnourished children and lactating caregivers with need based supplementary food for 6 months
3: Provide trainings and education to 200 caregivers on the importance of nutritious food preparation
4:Support two health institutions with routine drugs
5:Identify existing gaps in health services delivery of health extension workers, and provide the HEWs with need based capacity support. 
6: Support 1800HH with two years health insurance/medication cost coverage (9,000 people)
7: Provide dignity/sanitary kits to 400 in need women and school going girls.
8: Facilitate MHPSS capacity building training to 100 local government frontline  health workers                                                                                         Activities within Amhara Region: 1:Establish and support two Mobile Health and Nutrition Teams (MHNTs)
2:Rehabilitate Anti Retro VIral Treatment (ART) centers in three health centers
3: Support six health centers with medical equipment, Construct six delivery rooms. PRovide MHPSS services to conflict affected communities</narrative>
   </description>
